      "sourceTextSha256": "c7febd0660568a4283c383c006381bef14599561e7647db25c835c776725aa2c",
      "text": "2026 programme rates: from $5,096 per person for three travellers sharing a triple room (TRL). For two travellers sharing a double room (DBL), the rate is $5,506 per person. All flights are paid separately; the final price is confirmed when booking.",
